<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-BHP says Jabiru vessel to shut.</title>
<headline>RTRS-BHP says Jabiru vessel to shut.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Broken Hill Pty Co Ltd said on Thursday it would shut-in production of one of its three Jabiru Joint Venture floating oil production vessels in the Timor Sea on September 7 as part of a scheduled three-month refit.</p>
</text>
